      "Original": "Allows the sound from this plugin to play when the game is in the background.",
      "Translated": "允许在游戏处于后台时播放此插件的声音。",
      "Context": "PluginConfiguriation.Draw",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun"
    },
    {
