    {
      "Original": "Sets the timer for when the sound will play again. (In Seconds)\nEx: 0.4 will play the sound every 0.4 seconds.\nSet to -100 for no looping",
      "Translated": "设置声音再次播放的时间计时器。（以秒为单位）\n例如： 0.4将每0.4秒播放一次声音。\n设置为-100表示无循环",
      "Context": "PluginConfiguriation.LowHpSettings",
      "Source": "ai:public-caiyun"
    },
